* move Defend
  narration: It folds its arms inward and the projector lenses dim across all of them at once.

* move Heavy Attack
  narration: The arc-lance discharges in a clean wash of pale light across your line.
  narration: One arm pivots up and a calibrated lance fires square into your front.

* move Glowing Heavy Slow Telegraphed Attack
  narration: Both arms lock forward, every projector lens wakes amber, and the full volley fires: geometry of light, perfectly intersecting on you.

* move Heavy Power Recover
  narration: The chest plate seals, internal coils sing higher, and the visible damage closes itself in pale brightening light.

* intro
Past the gate, the abandoned city opens around you in clean imperial
geometry. Granaries closed, market stalls intact, doors shut on quiet
rooms. Something larger than a wagon stands at the next intersection,
beam projectors still warm. It raises one of its long arms toward you in
something like a salute, or a scan. The voice from its chest plate is
calm, conversational, addressed to no one in particular. "SENTINEL 7-C.
INNER PERIMETER. UNAUTHORIZED PRESENCE NOTED. COMMENCING ENFORCEMENT."
The Color in the projector lenses begins to wake.

* win
+give_gold 25
+add_tag killed_sentinel_7c
The projector lenses dim, hold a moment of pale amber, and go out. The
voice makes one last careful, conversational syllable, and the inner
perimeter is no longer enforced. The city goes on being abandoned.

* lose
The geometry of light intersects exactly where it was meant to. The voice
addresses no one in particular as the perimeter is, once again, enforced.
